                        



Item #:  SCP-5673

Object Class:  Safe

Special Containment Procedures:  SCP-5673 is to be contained in a sealed glass cover on a pedestal 42 inches in height, If the object is not contained 42 inches off the ground it will shake violently and will admit ionizing radiation until placed on any surface that is 42 inches specifically in height.

Description:  SCP-5673 is an indestructible black pen with no visible brand name given on the object. SCP-5673 has the strange ability to grant any wish written on any type of paper as long as the wish is not malicious or will cause harm to a living being the wish will be granted. If a wish is malicious or harmful to a living being, the pen user's blood will start to turn to ink, and their bones might snap but this isn't guaranteed. It was also found that the anomalous ink from SCP-5673 mixes with 50% of the users' blood when the user writes their wish on paper.

Addendum 5673-01:  A D-Class is instructed to write his wish with SCP-5673 on the paper in front of him. A few seconds pass as the D-Class writes  on the paper, After one minute the desired object appears on the table in front of the subject. The subject was told that they could not keep the cake and was escorted out of the room. The piece of chocolate cake was tested for anomalous properties, none were found.

Addendum 5673-02:  A D-Class is instructed to write his wish with SCP-5673 on the paper in front of him. A few seconds pass as the D-Class writes  on the paper, After one minute the D-Class starts to look visibly ill by their blood being turned into ink and their body starts to twist and break until the subject's death.

Addendum 5673-03:  A D-Class is instructed to write  on the paper in front of him. After one minute the D-Class starts to look visibly ill by their blood being turned into ink.

                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
